# Money-Math reads Bank of Thailand deposit rates through a small proxy (a Cloudflare Worker) that
# forwards to the BOT API. The URL ends up in the public JavaScript, so it is not a secret.
# Without it the app still works; the "use a bank's rate" pickers say rates are unavailable.
VITE_BOT_ENDPOINT="https://rates.thitichotk.com/api/deposit_rate"
